[sofnt:sectionCarte] > jnt:content, mix:title, sofmix:component, sofmix:headingStyle, sofmix:cta orderable
 - subtitle (string, textarea) i18n
 - eyebrow (string) i18n
 - image (weakreference, picker[type='image']) mandatory < jmix:image
